# AUTO FX (0.16.8, a settings page after AUTO DJ): effects played by themselves, each ending on a phrase line. Wild, every 4 bars, up to a bar: within a few
# phrases one is planned, ends on a line (a multiple of 64 sixteenths), sounds, and goes; one played by hand stops it; Off: none.
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 4
wait 100
expect fxpage 34
spin K1 3
spin K2 -1
wait 100
expect fxs92 3
expect fxs93 0
expect fxs94 2
shot autofx_page.png
# in the FX menu it waits
wait 9000
expect afplanned 0
tap FX
wait 500
expect view 0
# out of it: within 40 s (about 20 bars at the piece's tempo, five phrase lines at 90 %) one has been planned, on a line
waitfor afplanned 1 40000
expect afline 1
waitfor aflive 1 8000
expect fxmask >0
shot autofx_live.png
waitfor aflive 0 8000
# off: nothing more
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 4
wait 100
expect fxpage 34
spin K1 -3
wait 100
expect fxs92 0
tap FX
wait 500
wait 20000
expect afplanned 0
expect aflive 0
